1
00:00:00,562 --> 00:00:02,392
(Bernadette:)You one of those people?

2
00:00:03,365 --> 00:00:05,165
(Penny:)No. No, no, no.

3
00:00:05,166 --> 00:00:07,966
I-I think the cookie thing.

4
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:13,670
(Amy:)Action.

5
00:00:13,675 --> 00:00:15,505
(Sheldon:)Welcome back.

6
00:00:15,510 --> 00:00:18,180
(Sheldon:)Our guest today
is a returning fan favorite.

7
00:00:18,179 --> 00:00:20,579
(Sheldon:)He puts the reading
in your rainbow,

8
00:00:20,582 --> 00:00:22,012
(Sheldon:)the Geordi in your La Forge,

9
00:00:22,017 --> 00:00:23,917
(Sheldon:)and the Kunta in your Kinte,

10
00:00:23,919 --> 00:00:25,989
(Sheldon:)Mr. LeVar Burton.

11
00:00:30,525 --> 00:00:33,225
(LeVar Burton:)Thank you, Sheldon.
Now, remember our deal...

12
00:00:33,228 --> 00:00:37,698
(Sheldon:)You do this, I delete
your contact information.

13
00:00:37,699 --> 00:00:38,599
(Penny:)While...

14
00:00:38,600 --> 00:00:40,670
(Sheldon:)While you watch me do it.

15
00:00:40,669 --> 00:00:42,699
(LeVar:)Great. Happy to be back.

16
00:00:42,704 --> 00:00:44,534
(Sheldon:)Well, since you're here,

17
00:00:44,539 --> 00:00:46,909
(Sheldon:)I'd like to get your
opinion on something.

18
00:00:46,908 --> 00:00:49,008
In honor of Black
History Month,

19
00:00:49,010 --> 00:00:51,080
(Sheldon:)I portrayed George
Washington Carver

20
00:00:51,079 --> 00:00:55,719
(Sheldon:)in a loving tribute that my
roommate called "wildly racist."

21
00:00:55,717 --> 00:00:57,587
(Sheldon:)What do you think?

22
00:00:57,586 --> 00:00:59,786
SHELDON:
Hi. My name is George.

23
00:00:59,788 --> 00:01:04,028
Oh, hell, no!

